   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 3,000eb (Luxury)<br><strong>Covers:</strong> Head<br><strong>SP:</strong> 12<br><strong>Armor Penalty:</strong> none</p>\n<p>Built in: Anti-Smog Breathing Mask, Flashlight, Radio Communicator, and Smart Glasses upgraded to +1 option slot, holding Anti-Dazzle, Image Enhance, and TeleOptics. Raising or lowering the visor takes no Action. Lowered, your face is completely hidden and you get the Smart Glasses' cybereye options. With the visor down and Pilot Air Vehicle 7+ or Moto Rank 2+, +2 to Pilot Air Vehicle checks. That bonus is automated while the helmet is equipped; disable its effect if you don't qualify or the visor is up.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Armor Catalog).</em></p>"
